  "solution": {
    "text": "From KCL we have\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0038_e50afbc0beff.png\">\r\n\r\n$i=\\frac{72}{8 \\times 10^{3}}=9 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{A}$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\ni \\times 6 &=(9-i) \\times 3 \\\\\r\ni &=3 \\mathrm{mA}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$"
